50%+ web traffic, creating urgent new cybersecurity challenges. This article reveals 5 critical shifts every CISO must address in 2026 to stay secure and competitive.","cover":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/png;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/1f3bb2275d8c8e4452aeb61574a12f6b/c7240/BlogCloudflare.png","srcSet":"/static/1f3bb2275d8c8e4452aeb61574a12f6b/de3a1/BlogCloudflare.png 150w,\n/static/1f3bb2275d8c8e4452aeb61574a12f6b/30cdc/BlogCloudflare.png 300w,\n/static/1f3bb2275d8c8e4452aeb61574a12f6b/c7240/BlogCloudflare.png 600w","sizes":"(min-width: 600px) 600px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/1f3bb2275d8c8e4452aeb61574a12f6b/81307/BlogCloudflare.avif 150w,\n/static/1f3bb2275d8c8e4452aeb61574a12f6b/aa5b9/BlogCloudflare.avif 300w,\n/static/1f3bb2275d8c8e4452aeb61574a12f6b/0c8d0/BlogCloudflare.avif 600w","type":"image/avif","sizes":"(min-width: 600px) 600px, 100vw"},{"srcSet":"/static/1f3bb2275d8c8e4452aeb61574a12f6b/c65bc/BlogCloudflare.webp 150w,\n/static/1f3bb2275d8c8e4452aeb61574a12f6b/078c3/BlogCloudflare.webp 300w,\n/static/1f3bb2275d8c8e4452aeb61574a12f6b/6d09e/BlogCloudflare.webp 600w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 600px) 600px, 100vw"}]},"width":600,"height":600}}}},"wordCount":{"words":1420}},{"id":"08041aba-cc6f-525b-99a7-e8685b77de3a","frontmatter":{"date":"12 Sep 2025","title":"Klarna just raised $1.37B — and proved why AI still needs humans","text":"Big moment for European tech: Klarna finally went public in the US. Shares jumped 30% on the first day, giving the company a $17B market cap. Investors are clearly betting big on its future. But here’s the irony: while the IPO is a success story, Klarna’s AI experiment tells a different one.Not long ago, the company shifted hundreds of engineers, marketers, and even lawyers out of their roles, betting that AI could replace 700 customer support agents.","cover":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/png;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/ff6d210c61a23fdf4a25914a5a77dcc5/c7240/Klarnawebsite.png","srcSet":"/static/ff6d210c61a23fdf4a25914a5a77dcc5/de3a1/Klarnawebsite.png 150w,\n/static/ff6d210c61a23fdf4a25914a5a77dcc5/30cdc/Klarnawebsite.png 300w,\n/static/ff6d210c61a23fdf4a25914a5a77dcc5/c7240/Klarnawebsite.png 600w","sizes":"(min-width: 600px) 600px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/ff6d210c61a23fdf4a25914a5a77dcc5/81307/Klarnawebsite.avif 150w,\n/static/ff6d210c61a23fdf4a25914a5a77dcc5/aa5b9/Klarnawebsite.avif 300w,\n/static/ff6d210c61a23fdf4a25914a5a77dcc5/0c8d0/Klarnawebsite.avif 600w","type":"image/avif","sizes":"(min-width: 600px) 600px, 100vw"},{"srcSet":"/static/ff6d210c61a23fdf4a25914a5a77dcc5/c65bc/Klarnawebsite.webp 150w,\n/static/ff6d210c61a23fdf4a25914a5a77dcc5/078c3/Klarnawebsite.webp 300w,\n/static/ff6d210c61a23fdf4a25914a5a77dcc5/6d09e/Klarnawebsite.webp 600w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 600px) 600px, 100vw"}]},"width":600,"height":600}}}},"wordCount":{"words":470}},{"id":"5070b352-0fe6-5a5a-a1e2-65a8ef238804","frontmatter":{"date":"02 May 2025","title":"We saved our customer more than $50k on hype-driven ChatGPT v4 integration, by using a self-hosted Machine Learning model","text":"One of our clients was about to drop $50,000+ on a flashy AI integration.All they really needed was a way to organize thousands of customer messages and migrate messy data. But everyone was telling them: “Just use GPT-4.”","cover":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/png;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/97aa7f6539ebfa733c2f7c005760f6d2/c7240/50kenginst.png","srcSet":"/static/97aa7f6539ebfa733c2f7c005760f6d2/de3a1/50kenginst.png 150w,\n/static/97aa7f6539ebfa733c2f7c005760f6d2/30cdc/50kenginst.png 300w,\n/static/97aa7f6539ebfa733c2f7c005760f6d2/c7240/50kenginst.png 600w","sizes":"(min-width: 600px) 600px, 100vw"},"source